  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Ever since download prioritization was removed my time in VRChat has been painful, with avatars taking significantly longer to download since they now all seemingly attempt to download at once. I currently have a slow internet connection (<50 Mbps) and my entire experience slows to a crawl when this happens. I had originally used download prioritization to help mitigate this, and I can't be the only one that did either.\n\nI think the removal of this feature was an absolutely absurd and terrible decision on VRChat's part. Please, for the sake of those who actually relied on this to have a decent experience, bring this back.",
